{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13102","headline":"与张补阙王链师自徐方清路同舟南下於台头寺留别赵员外裴补阙同赋杂题一首 · 皇甫冉","name":"与张补阙王链师自徐方清路同舟南下於台头寺留别赵员外裴补阙同赋杂题一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝朝春事晚，泛泛行舟远。\n淮海思无穷，悠扬烟景中。\n幸将仙子去，复与故人同。\n高枕随流水，轻帆任远风。\n钟声野寺逈，草色故城空。\n送别高台上，裴回共惆怅。\n悬知白日斜，定是犹相望。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13102.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13102","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}